  "evidence": [
    {
      "id": "E1",
      "source": "ORG-01",
      "quote": "Org chart (2026): Retail Banking over the Branch Network; Business Banking over the relationship managers; Operations over loan operations. Digital Channels, Credit and Risk, Compliance and Legal, Technology, HR, Finance and the Programme Office report to the Executive Committee. Internal Audit reports to the Audit Committee.",
      "speaker": "",
      "attribution": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "E2",
      "source": "INT-01",
      "quote": "We re-key every application three times: once at the branch, once in credit, once in the core system. My team wants the new platform yesterday.",
      "speaker": "Head of Loan Operations",
      "attribution": "testimony"
    },
    {
      "id": "E3",
      "source": "INT-01",
      "quote": "The RMs email me the urgent cases and I fix them quietly so the customer is not told it is stuck. It works, but it is not in any process.",
      "speaker": "Head of Loan Operations",
      "attribution": "testimony"
    },
    {
      "id": "E4",
      "source": "INT-01",
      "quote": "Credit officers ring Marcus's compliance team informally before they decline anything sensitive.",
      "speaker": "Head of Loan Operations",
      "attribution": "claim"
    },
    {
      "id": "E5",
      "source": "INT-02",
      "quote": "Any change to how we capture customer due diligence data has to be notified to MAS. I speak to our MAS supervisor before we file, always.",
      "speaker": "Head of Compliance",
      "attribution": "testimony"
    },
    {
      "id": "E6",
      "source": "INT-02",
      "quote": "I will not sign off a platform that cannot show an auditor who approved what, and when.",
      "speaker": "Head of Compliance",
      "attribution": "testimony"
    },
    {
      "id": "E7",
      "source": "INT-02",
      "quote": "I heard the top RMs have told Business Banking leadership they will not use the new platform for their large cases.",
      "speaker": "Head of Compliance",
      "attribution": "hearsay"
    },
    {
      "id": "E8",
      "source": "INT-03",
      "quote": "My clients expect a decision in 48 hours. If the new platform adds a step, I will find another way to get the case through.",
      "speaker": "Senior relationship manager",
      "attribution": "testimony"
    },
    {
      "id": "E9",
      "source": "INT-03",
      "quote": "The junior RMs watch what I do. If I use it, they use it. If I work around it, so do they.",
      "speaker": "Senior relationship manager",
      "attribution": "testimony"
    },
    {
      "id": "E10",
      "source": "INT-03",
      "quote": "Credit approvers will not use any screen Dr Chong has not personally walked through.",
      "speaker": "Senior relationship manager",
      "attribution": "claim"
    },
    {
      "id": "E11",
      "source": "INT-04",
      "quote": "Benedict sponsors it, and the CEO has asked him for a go-live date three times. He asks me the same question after each Exco.",
      "speaker": "Programme Director",
      "attribution": "testimony"
    },
    {
      "id": "E12",
      "source": "INT-04",
      "quote": "Technology owns the release calendar. We were given one window in the year, and nobody outside Arjun's team can move it.",
      "speaker": "Programme Director",
      "attribution": "testimony"
    },
    {
      "id": "E13",
      "source": "INT-04",
      "quote": "The union has not been briefed. HR says it is not needed because no roles are going. I am not sure the branches agree.",
      "speaker": "Programme Director",
      "attribution": "testimony"
    },
    {
      "id": "E14",
      "source": "INT-04",
      "quote": "Internal Audit have asked to attend the design workshops as observers. Gabriel sits in the corner and says nothing.",
      "speaker": "Programme Director",
      "attribution": "claim"
    },
    {
      "id": "E15",
      "source": "INT-05",
